# BUG: Ring Oscillator 5 — FAIL 3.76e+02

## Circuit
`ring_oscillator_5.sp` — 5-stage CMOS ring oscillator, transient

## Symptom
FAIL with relative error 3.76e+02 (37600%) vs ngspice.

## Root Cause (suspected)
Same MOSFET Level 1 model issue as cmos_inverter_tran.sp.
The ring oscillator relies on MOSFET switching — if NMOS/PMOS don't switch correctly,
oscillation won't start and BigOSpice will output wrong DC-like values.

## Key Files
- `crates/device/src/mosfet.rs` — Level 1 eval (same fix as CMOS inverter)
